 plus 2 ions (one '+' with a left arrow high in the beaker, one '−' with a right arrow mid-beaker). Particle counts scale linearly with the concentration slider (multiply base counts by 2×concentration, min 1 neutral pair). Bulb brightness: ethanol emissive = 0 always; KCl emissive = concentration (bright yellow #ffe14d core with a soft radial glow); acetic acid emissive = 0.25 × concentration (faint warm tint, small halo). Colors: glass #cfe3e6 at ~25% opacity, liquid #bfe7ee at ~45% opacity, electrode grey #9a9a9a with lighter #c8c8c8 highlight edge, wires/plug matte black #1a1a1a, outlet plate #8d9298, caption text dark grey #333 on two lines centered under the beaker at y ≈ -1.8.",
