// bulb glass      → SphereGeometry(0.45) + neck cone         white physical, emissive yellow
// bulb base       → CylinderGeometry(0.17,0.19,0.4) + 3 ribs #9aa0a6
// filament        → TorusGeometry(0.07,0.015) + 2 posts      emissive #ff9b2e
// glow halo       → Sprite(additive radial canvas texture)   #ffe14d
// neutral molecule→ Group(2 × SphereGeometry(0.10))          #7ac143
// ion             → SphereGeometry(0.10) + billboard glyph   #7ac143
